WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:04.460
I wonder how a person can
become strong like that?

00:05.170 --> 00:08.270
Zed was fighting all along,

00:08.270 --> 00:11.010
with something that welled up
from inside himself.

00:11.010 --> 00:13.440
Searching for the answers with
everything he had.

00:14.510 --> 00:17.880
I imagine that hasn't changed, even now.

00:19.780 --> 00:23.240
That's Zed's strength?

00:25.320 --> 00:27.990
I'm going to try my best.

00:27.990 --> 00:31.190
I'll try to fight with all I have
in search of the answers.

00:47.640 --> 00:55.250
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:55.250 --> 00:58.420
Utatte iru

00:58.420 --> 01:06.060
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:06.060 --> 01:09.330
Shimaikonde

01:09.330 --> 01:19.910
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:19.910 --> 01:25.350
Ayumou

01:25.350 --> 01:30.750
Susumou

01:30.750 --> 01:35.590
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:35.590 --> 01:41.060
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:41.060 --> 01:46.530
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:46.530 --> 01:51.770
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:51.770 --> 01:55.800
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:57.450 --> 02:00.970
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:07.020 --> 02:10.750
Episode 28
Proof of Existence

02:22.840 --> 02:25.270
Good luck, Roya.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.470
Begin!

02:48.760 --> 02:51.700
I wonder what's the matter?

02:51.700 --> 02:55.160
Perhaps this competition is too much for Roya.

02:55.800 --> 02:58.430
Just shut up and watch.

03:15.920 --> 03:18.490
You're no match for me.

03:18.490 --> 03:21.860
If you forfeit the fight,
you'll avoid getting injured.

03:22.600 --> 03:24.390
As if!

03:29.240 --> 03:31.710
What a sissy match.

03:31.710 --> 03:33.500
This is so boring.

03:34.440 --> 03:38.210
I will win this Joust,

03:38.210 --> 03:40.770
and I'll get that key spirit.

03:41.680 --> 03:47.060
And with that power I'll defeat Hugh
and become the king of Zymot!

03:47.060 --> 03:48.290
Nudyu...

03:48.290 --> 03:50.390
I'll give you a word of advice.

03:50.390 --> 03:52.730
If you keep taking Hugh lightly,

03:52.730 --> 03:54.520
you'll die.

03:57.500 --> 03:59.590
You'll see soon enough.

04:03.300 --> 04:05.840
If they let you represent Templar at your level,

04:05.840 --> 04:08.510
the other representatives can't amount to much.

04:08.510 --> 04:10.140
Apcarel!

04:14.050 --> 04:15.680
Buvaris!

04:29.730 --> 04:34.230
I regret to say that your Roya girl's
spirit has no chance.

04:34.770 --> 04:38.640
That doesn't necessarily mean she'll lose.

04:38.640 --> 04:42.740
If nothing else, she wins in the looks department!

04:44.850 --> 04:46.810
Ginga...

04:46.810 --> 04:49.880
Why won't you participate in the Joust?

04:49.880 --> 04:54.580
With power like yours,
you might emerge the victor.

04:56.560 --> 04:59.530
See, I'm shyer than you might think.

04:59.530 --> 05:02.790
I'm just no good at the " in the spotlight" thing.

05:04.730 --> 05:06.530
You never change.

05:32.390 --> 05:34.530
I won't lose no matter what!

05:34.530 --> 05:36.560
I'm going to find the answer!

05:36.560 --> 05:40.470
I'm going to find the answer to how
I should live at this Joust!

05:40.470 --> 05:42.400
What's necessary in battle is
the cool-headedness

05:42.400 --> 05:45.540
to unerringly aim for your opponent's vital points.

05:45.540 --> 05:48.300
Immature emotions like that are useless!

05:50.980 --> 05:53.050
Roya!

05:53.050 --> 05:57.350
Roya, I can feel your determination from here.

05:57.920 --> 06:02.080
However, Kira is a seasoned warrior of Neotopia.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.690
You're just up against someone too strong.

06:12.900 --> 06:14.700
It's over!

06:19.570 --> 06:23.810
Oh dear, Roya seems to be in trouble there,
don't you think?

06:25.550 --> 06:27.550
Don't give up, Roya!

06:27.550 --> 06:29.350
I know you can win!

06:30.550 --> 06:32.180
Roya...

06:44.330 --> 06:45.930
You're quite stubborn,

06:45.930 --> 06:48.870
but it's only a matter of time.

06:48.870 --> 06:50.670
Hurry up and fall!

06:58.510 --> 07:00.210
It's no good.

07:00.210 --> 07:02.510
This might be too much for me after all.

07:03.680 --> 07:06.320
In the end, I'm just a pathetic girl.

07:06.320 --> 07:10.190
No matter what I do, I do a pathetic job.

07:13.760 --> 07:16.360
Master Zico, wait!

07:17.060 --> 07:19.690
Zed! Mother!

07:20.440 --> 07:24.340
Don't go! Don't leave me behind!

07:29.440 --> 07:31.880
I have to go forward.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.150
What?!

07:34.150 --> 07:37.590
That's right, my only choice is go forward!

07:37.590 --> 07:39.380
Somewhere ahead...

07:40.620 --> 07:42.750
...there must be a place for me to live!

07:46.430 --> 07:48.220
Why, you!

08:22.200 --> 08:24.600
Stop, Roya!

08:32.210 --> 08:34.230
I give.

08:34.910 --> 08:37.170
The winner: Roya!

08:44.050 --> 08:45.680
Roya...

08:53.460 --> 08:56.190
Was that the true extent of our power?

08:57.130 --> 08:59.530
I apologize, Your Holiness.

08:59.530 --> 09:02.600
Bring that Zed boy here.

09:02.600 --> 09:04.400
At once.

09:08.140 --> 09:12.740
Hey, Roya, snap out of it! Roya!

09:18.250 --> 09:19.880
Noah?

09:20.420 --> 09:22.220
Lady Diana...

09:23.160 --> 09:27.800
Noah, Holy Father Hyrum has sent me
with a message for you.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.590
Yes, ma'am.

09:41.580 --> 09:42.840
Roya!

09:42.840 --> 09:44.470
Roya?

09:48.050 --> 09:52.180
Roya, are you okay?

09:54.120 --> 09:55.750
Yeah...

09:57.190 --> 09:58.430
Zed?

09:58.430 --> 10:00.390
Yeah?

10:00.390 --> 10:04.100
Did I win?

10:04.100 --> 10:05.330
Yep!

10:05.330 --> 10:06.970
Okay...

10:06.970 --> 10:08.600
But it's no good.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.100
What are you talking about?!

10:10.100 --> 10:13.270
You won! Isn't that enough?!

10:14.240 --> 10:16.340
No, I mean...

10:16.340 --> 10:20.080
I didn't find any answers.

10:21.780 --> 10:26.220
So, it's no good...

10:27.790 --> 10:30.490
Hey, snap out of it! Roya!

10:30.490 --> 10:31.860
Roya!

10:31.860 --> 10:33.490
Roya!

10:34.130 --> 10:35.760
Noah!

10:36.260 --> 10:39.860
Please, please help Roya!

10:40.430 --> 10:42.800
I know, I will.

10:44.070 --> 10:48.840
I'll make the necessary arrangements for Roya
to be treated at the central hospital.

10:48.840 --> 10:49.840
It will be okay.

10:49.840 --> 10:51.310
I'm sure she'll be better in no time.

10:51.310 --> 10:54.480
After all, Neotopia's medical science
is the world's best.

10:55.550 --> 10:57.990
I'm counting on you, Noah.

10:57.990 --> 10:59.920
Leave it to me.

10:59.920 --> 11:04.830
Now, Zed, would you come with me for a bit?

11:04.830 --> 11:07.730
Apparently, Holy Father Hyrum
wants to talk to you.

11:08.530 --> 11:10.460
Hyrum?

11:10.460 --> 11:16.240
Yeah, you're lucky to even be
able to meet him, Zed.

11:16.240 --> 11:18.210
But Roya...

11:18.210 --> 11:20.710
No need to worry.

11:20.710 --> 11:24.410
Sagiri will stay with Roya.

11:24.410 --> 11:25.450
Right?

11:25.450 --> 11:27.070
Yep!

11:31.590 --> 11:34.210
We will now begin Round One Match Four.

11:35.560 --> 11:40.580
Geh-Geh of Tusk vs. Brian of Neotopia.

11:49.100 --> 11:50.730
Begin!

11:53.070 --> 11:57.240
First of all, Zed, your victory in
the first round was splendid.

11:58.250 --> 12:03.780
Your spirit, Amir Gaul, is one of the key spirits,

12:03.780 --> 12:09.810
and Noah there also has a key spirit,
called Sachura.

12:10.620 --> 12:12.190
And?

12:12.190 --> 12:14.700
I will come right to the point.

12:14.700 --> 12:18.830
Will you join Neotopia?

12:18.830 --> 12:20.700
What?

12:20.700 --> 12:26.740
Deepening the understanding between
nations is one goal of this Joust,

12:26.740 --> 12:30.240
but it is also a way to search out
talented individuals.

12:30.240 --> 12:35.980
Zed, I want you.

12:37.990 --> 12:43.750
I hear you and Noah are childhood friends
from the same otherworld.

12:44.530 --> 12:46.860
Doesn't this seem like fate?

12:49.460 --> 12:51.090
Zed...

12:51.530 --> 12:55.490
You can have no reason to stay in Templar.

12:57.100 --> 12:58.710
Together with Noah,
I would like you to lend me your aid,

12:58.710 --> 13:01.180
for the sake of Neotopia...

13:01.180 --> 13:06.410
Nay, for the peace of our entire world.

13:06.410 --> 13:11.650
As you know, in this world each territory
struggles for supremacy,

13:11.650 --> 13:14.360
and much blood is spilled.

13:14.360 --> 13:19.790
However, by propagating Neotopia's
Absolute Law,

13:19.790 --> 13:24.730
we will bring about true peace,
and many people will be saved!

13:27.540 --> 13:28.670
What say you?

13:28.670 --> 13:33.040
Will you work for the sake of true peace?

13:33.040 --> 13:36.480
You and Noah, joining forces?

13:58.700 --> 14:01.600
The winner: Geh-Geh of Tusk!

14:15.450 --> 14:17.080
Roya...

14:18.090 --> 14:20.720
This is strange...

14:20.720 --> 14:22.560
Her injuries aren't severe.

14:22.560 --> 14:25.430
It would be natural for her to
regain consciousness.

14:25.430 --> 14:28.450
Perhaps she suffered a great
psychological shock.

14:29.730 --> 14:31.600
I'm afraid you're right.

14:31.600 --> 14:33.570
Roya...

14:35.440 --> 14:37.370
Mother...

14:37.370 --> 14:39.000
Roya!

14:39.770 --> 14:41.640
Master Zico...

14:43.780 --> 14:45.010
Zed...

14:45.010 --> 14:47.850
Roya, hang in there!

14:47.850 --> 14:52.410
Don't leave me behind...

14:57.320 --> 15:01.530
I didn't think anyone would be
trying to recruit me.

15:01.530 --> 15:04.900
Zed, I'll add my request to his.

15:04.900 --> 15:07.600
I want you to fight with me.

15:07.600 --> 15:10.300
To propagate Absolute Law.

15:10.300 --> 15:13.670
If we do that, everyone can live in peace!

15:13.670 --> 15:16.370
Yeah, I'd like that too,

15:17.710 --> 15:20.840
if it could really bring about peace.

15:22.120 --> 15:23.910
What do you mean?

15:27.860 --> 15:32.950
This Absolute Law thing just
doesn't sit well with me.

15:33.860 --> 15:38.630
Can something like that really give
everyone peaceful lives?

15:41.800 --> 15:43.470
I know,

15:43.470 --> 15:50.430
you've hated being bound by laws and
rules since before we left Calm.

15:51.510 --> 15:55.310
But Zed, did you gain happiness that way?

15:55.850 --> 15:57.480
What?

15:57.920 --> 16:01.720
To me, it seems like the more you
struggled against the rules,

16:01.720 --> 16:05.520
the worse things got for you.

16:06.390 --> 16:08.020
Noah...

16:08.930 --> 16:11.400
After coming to Neotopia,

16:11.400 --> 16:16.100
I learned to value the law,
and saw how wonderful it can be.

16:17.300 --> 16:20.670
So, I want you to understand too!

16:20.670 --> 16:25.980
To understand that the strength I have
now is all thanks to this country!

16:26.580 --> 16:29.310
It's thanks to Absolute Law!

16:32.350 --> 16:35.520
Zed! Zed!

16:35.720 --> 16:39.420
Zed! It's Roya!

16:43.660 --> 16:46.200
Her life is in no danger.

16:46.200 --> 16:51.510
However, psychological shock or
some other factor has her in a coma.

16:51.510 --> 16:54.880
We'll continue to observe her
condition for a while longer.

16:54.880 --> 16:56.670
I see.

16:57.210 --> 16:59.010
Please excuse me.

17:00.950 --> 17:04.150
Sagiri, let's go back to the Joust stadium.

17:04.150 --> 17:05.780
Okay...

17:15.000 --> 17:17.620
We will now begin Round One Match Five.

17:19.430 --> 17:21.700
Chavez of Neotopia vs. Elmeida of Zymot.

17:21.700 --> 17:23.870
Show us a good fight, Chavez!
Chavez of Neotopia vs. Elmeida of Zymot.

17:23.870 --> 17:25.070
Chavez of Neotopia vs. Elmeida of Zymot.

17:26.670 --> 17:29.010
We've got high hopes, Chavez!

17:30.740 --> 17:32.370
Begin!

17:47.590 --> 17:50.560
Where am I?

17:50.560 --> 17:56.060
Could I be dead?

18:03.110 --> 18:04.910
Mother...

18:08.150 --> 18:11.950
Am I dead?

18:11.950 --> 18:15.390
Can we be together now, Mother?

18:28.840 --> 18:30.630
So warm...

18:31.740 --> 18:33.730
She's so warm...

18:50.320 --> 18:53.850
Mother, thank you.

19:05.370 --> 19:08.900
I see Neotopia isn't much to write home about.

19:09.880 --> 19:13.940
The winner: Elmeida of Zymot!

19:15.750 --> 19:18.220
You're kidding... How...

19:18.220 --> 19:20.120
Chavez lost...

19:24.530 --> 19:26.330
I... I can't believe this!

19:26.330 --> 19:28.900
Look! My leg is healed!

19:28.900 --> 19:30.690
It's healed!

19:35.600 --> 19:37.040
Roya!

19:37.040 --> 19:39.510
What are you doing, Roya?

19:39.510 --> 19:41.910
Are you well enough to be up?

19:43.080 --> 19:44.870
I'm sorry, Zed.

19:45.510 --> 19:47.980
Don't worry about me, I'm fine now.

19:47.980 --> 19:52.480
But when did you get a healing shard?

19:53.190 --> 19:56.210
I got it from Mother in my dreams.

19:57.760 --> 20:03.430
Up until now, I've only thought
about becoming stronger.

20:03.430 --> 20:06.700
I wanted Master Zico and everyone
else to acknowledge me.

20:07.900 --> 20:10.370
And I wanted to catch up to you, Zed.

20:10.370 --> 20:12.670
I was only thinking of myself.

20:13.770 --> 20:20.380
But see, in my dream, when Mother held
me in her arms, I realized...

20:20.380 --> 20:24.380
I want to help people too.

20:24.380 --> 20:28.380
I want to use my abilities to save
people who are hurt.

20:30.020 --> 20:32.050
I was able to let go and see that.

20:33.360 --> 20:35.020
Roya...

20:36.160 --> 20:38.760
You there! What are you doing?!

20:39.500 --> 20:43.140
Unauthorized medical treatment is
against regulations.

20:43.140 --> 20:44.370
Bring her in.

20:44.370 --> 20:46.010
Yes, sir!

20:46.010 --> 20:48.280
Wh..What's with this?

20:48.280 --> 20:50.180
What's this about?!

20:50.180 --> 20:50.580
Let's go, you're coming with us.

20:50.580 --> 20:51.680
Hold it! Where are you taking Roya?!
Let's go, you're coming with us.

20:51.680 --> 20:53.050
Hold it! Where are you taking Roya?!
Come along quietly.

20:53.050 --> 20:54.050
What's going on?!
Come along quietly.

20:54.050 --> 20:56.280
Hey! Let go of me!

20:57.420 --> 20:59.610
Hey, I said hold it!

21:00.420 --> 21:01.420
Hey! Let go of me!

21:01.420 --> 21:03.060
Noah!
Hey! Let go of me!

21:03.060 --> 21:05.330
What the hell is this about?!

21:05.330 --> 21:07.660
What's Roya done wrong?!

21:07.660 --> 21:09.130
Well?!

21:09.130 --> 21:11.530
I heard everything from the nurse.

21:12.500 --> 21:16.970
In Neotopia, unauthorized medical
treatment is not allowed.

21:16.970 --> 21:18.340
What are you talking about?

21:18.340 --> 21:20.510
What's wrong with saving people?!

21:20.510 --> 21:22.840
It's the law.

21:22.840 --> 21:28.250
Medical treatment is dangerous
unless properly managed.

21:28.250 --> 21:31.810
What's more, it can be a method of winning
people's hearts to your side.

21:32.590 --> 21:35.390
What the hell?! That makes no sense!

21:35.390 --> 21:38.090
Hurry up and tell them to let Roya go!

21:38.090 --> 21:38.890
No.

21:38.890 --> 21:40.190
What?!
No.

21:40.190 --> 21:44.060
If you take this any further,

21:44.060 --> 21:48.830
I'll have to arrest you for interfering
with official duties.

21:49.300 --> 21:50.930
What?!

21:52.470 --> 21:54.070
Why you...

21:54.070 --> 21:57.480
Like hell I can follow your Absolute Law!

21:57.480 --> 21:58.880
Get out of my way.

21:58.880 --> 22:00.680
Give Roya back!

22:02.280 --> 22:07.220
You're just the same as you were back in Calm.

22:08.420 --> 22:11.190
You'd better grow up a little.

22:15.260 --> 22:17.830
Absolute Law my ass!

22:17.830 --> 22:20.670
I can't trust something like that!

22:20.670 --> 22:23.230
You don't understand anything.

22:23.740 --> 22:25.770
To have true peace,

22:25.770 --> 22:29.070
we need laws to rule the people.

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:12.050
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.760 --> 23:24.030
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.030 --> 23:26.700
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.870 --> 23:31.510
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.580 --> 23:37.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:17.320 --> 24:20.880
Next Time
Friendship at Cross-Purposes

24:17.720 --> 24:20.880


Next time, "Friendship at Cross-Purposes"
